  "limitations": [
    "The full 20-gate quality run is separately observed via make verify-exec-05. The short manifest audit checks the actual matching external record, not authenticated execution, and cannot replace that run.",
    "Local API journeys use real SQLite and runtime services; PostgreSQL fixtures do not constitute a live PostgreSQL installation. All provider and connector effects remain deterministic mocks.",
    "Brief resources are standalone. All executable workflows retain their existing forbidden-brief policy. Projection expiry is not physical erasure, and structured redaction is not arbitrary free-text DLP.",
    "Schedule disable does not cancel admitted work. Keyset pages are not frozen snapshots, and UTC previews are recurrence metadata, not promises of execution. Unconfirmed mutation outcomes require inspection before retry.",
    "Browser timeline checks establish rendered/public-projection consistency. Independent persisted-fact completeness remains covered by the unchanged complete AC-14 suite, not inferred solely from two API projections.",
    "This qualifies the present M7-M8 product surface after EXEC-04, not historical implementation order. It does not complete DEL-01, EXEC-07 clean-state acceptance, new kernel-level AC-15 verification, production identity or real external delivery.",
    "CI remains disabled. No Docker setting, network check, coverage threshold, complete-suite inventory or existing deadline is weakened; no existing application database is migrated by verification."
  ]
